title: SAP MaxDB: Transaction runtime
agents: linux, windows
catalog: app/maxdb
license: GPL
distribution: check_mk
description:
 Checks the age of the sampled active transaction. Current agent data does not guarantee that this is the oldest transaction.
 Requires the MaxDB agent plugin with the maxdb_transactions module enabled.
 Thresholds can be configured using the MaxDB extended monitoring ruleset.
item:
 Database name
discovery:
 One service is discovered for each database with the corresponding agent section.
